        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ [þæt] man frið ⁊ freondscipe rihtlice healde [innan þysan earde for Gode ⁊ for worolde.]</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">and that peace and good-will shall be duly maintained [within this land in matters both religious and secular].</ab>
